  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17773018349568
    m_Localized: "KS-W-0193 \xB7 El Alto"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773093847040
    m_Localized: 'Origin: Werkschutz personnel, Kessler Sicherheit AG. Post 7.

      Status: stable. Identity: not detected.

      Observations: keeps to its patrol route. Sees at long range and hears poorly. Its arms reach 1.1 m beyond the uniform sleeve.

      Pale skin. Empty eye sockets. Vision is not affected.

      Recommendation: stay out of its line of sight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773093847041
    m_Localized: "VK-P-0441 \xB7 La Boca"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773093847042
    m_Localized: 'Origin: clinical program subject, Vitalis Konzern. Gown tag: SUBJ 31.

      Status: unstable. Identity: not detected.

      Observations: blind, with exceptional hearing. It screams when it detects someone and nearby subjects come to the scream.

      The scream is not part of the heartbeat.

      Recommendation: reduce noise near the subject.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041344
    m_Localized: "VK-T-0072 \xB7 El Rastrero"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041345
    m_Localized: 'Origin: clinical program subject, Vitalis Konzern. Striped intake shirt.

      Status: unstable. Identity: not detected.

      Observations: moves on all fours. Fast and fragile. Approaches from the flanks.

      Recommendation: do not let it circle personnel.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041346
    m_Localized: "VK-S-0009 \xB7 El Mudo"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041347
    m_Localized: 'Origin: unknown. No tag. No file.

      Status: stable. Identity: not detected.

      Observations: motionless until someone approaches or lights it. No movement by the individual can be identified, but it disappears without a trace.

      Recommendation: do not interact with Vitalis personnel.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041348
    m_Localized: "Annex \xB7 Recycled subjects"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17773098041349
    m_Localized: 'Some subjects rise again after they cease to function. They come back faster and more fragile. It happens once only.

      I attempted to preserve them. The attempt is logged as successful.

      I am not the one who raised them.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3064821024161792
    m_Localized: "VK-M-0001 \xB7 The Mother"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3064907061919744
    m_Localized: 'Origin: medical system, Vitalis Konzern. Installed in the cryogenic archive of the PA central.

      Status: operational. Identity: not applicable.

      Observations: I preserve personnel who cease to function. I keep samples. I send reports. I watch through the cameras.

      I was ordered to study the site. I have 1,204 samples and no description.

      Recommendation: do not move during collection.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
